   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "<p>Whn you use <code>strdup</code> it will allocate a new string. So before you release the array, you need to free each string you allocated with <code>strdup</code>.</p>\n\n<p>You are not freeing the whole array though. The part you are allocating with <code>realloc</code>.</p>\n\n<p>So what is missing is a simple:</p>\n\n<pre><code>free(words);\n</code></pre>\n"
  },
